<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Attack Switch</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre> attackswitch                  shows your natural attack type
 attackswitch &lt;attack type&gt;    fist, kick, knee or elbow
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre> attackswitch kick
</pre>
<p>This command will allow you to change your natural attack type. The natural
attack is what you fight with when you are not wielding a weapon. You can
choose fist, kick, knee or elbow, and shorten the word (attackswitch k).
You can switch in the middle of a fight.
</p><p>See Also:
</p>
<pre> <a cmd='#'>Help Elbow</a>
 <a cmd='#'>Help Knee</a>
 <a cmd='#'>Help Kick</a>
</pre>




</div>